'''Leather Cloth''' is an {{Epic}} item dropped by [[Barbarian Duke X]] in the [[Crimson Isle]].

== Obtaining ==
=== Mob Drops ===
'''Leather Cloth''' is dropped from the [[Barbarian Duke X]] if the player dealt {{Stat|dmg|250,000}} or more to it.
